[
  {
    "start": 26.57,
    "end": 30.55,
    "dur": 3.98,
    "emotion": "HAPPY",
    "text": "不知道干什么的话要不要我带你去转转呀"
  },
  {
    "start": 37.42,
    "end": 42.16,
    "dur": 4.74,
    "emotion": "HAPPY",
    "text": "又有心事吗我来陪你一起想吧"
  },
  {
    "start": 48.05,
    "end": 52.77,
    "dur": 4.72,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "果然要亲眼去看才能感受到世界的美"
  },
  {
    "start": 61.28,
    "end": 65.2,
    "dur": 3.92,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "快去避雨吧小心头顶上长出蘑菇"
  },
  {
    "start": 73.98,
    "end": 81.64,
    "dur": 7.66,
    "emotion": "HAPPY",
    "text": "你知道吗雷鸣是生命的前奏很快这片大地就会充满生机"
  },
  {
    "start": 89.84,
    "end": 96.61,
    "dur": 6.77,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "听见了吗天空正对万物轻雨睡觉时间到了"
  },
  {
    "start": 104.4,
    "end": 111.16,
    "dur": 6.76,
    "emotion": "HAPPY",
    "text": "天气真好呀暖洋洋的我们的身边马上也要热闹起来了"
  },
  {
    "start": 118.14,
    "end": 120.66,
    "dur": 2.52,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "宫殿里可不会起风呢"
  },
  {
    "start": 122.21,
    "end": 123.41,
    "dur": 1.2,
    "emotion": "EMO_UNKNOWN",
    "text": "落ち"
  },
  {
    "start": 123.61,
    "end": 124.99,
    "dur": 1.38,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "对你来说"
  },
  {
    "start": 124.99,
    "end": 126.84,
    "dur": 1.85,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "是理所当然的知识吧"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.68,
    "end": 133.98,
    "dur": 1.3,
    "emotion": "HAPPY",
    "text": "早上好"
  },
  {
    "start": 133.98,
    "end": 135.53,
    "dur": 1.55,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "我们赶快出发吧"
  },
  {
    "start": 135.94,
    "end": 139.84,
    "dur": 3.9,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "这世上有太多的东西都是过时不候的呢"
  },
  {
    "start": 146.3,
    "end": 147.81,
    "dur": 1.51,
    "emotion": "HAPPY",
    "text": "午休时间到"
  },
  {
    "start": 148.2,
    "end": 149.77,
    "dur": 1.57,
    "emotion": "SAD",
    "text": "我想喝"
  },
  {
    "start": 149.77,
    "end": 151.12,
    "dur": 1.35,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "树莓不荷影"
  },
  {
    "start": 151.62,
    "end": 154.38,
    "dur": 2.76,
    "emotion": "HAPPY",
    "text": "用两个和太阳有关的故事和你画"
  },
  {
    "start": 154.38,
    "end": 155.42,
    "dur": 1.04,
    "emotion": "EMO_UNKNOWN",
    "text": "好不好"
  },
  {
    "start": 160.71,
    "end": 162.24,
    "dur": 1.53,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "太阳落山了"
  },
  {
    "start": 162.24,
    "end": 166.0,
    "dur": 3.76,
    "emotion": "HAPPY",
    "text": "我们也该把舞台让给夜行的大家族了"
  },
  {
    "start": 171.39,
    "end": 172.86,
    "dur": 1.47,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "快去睡吧"
  },
  {
    "start": 172.93,
    "end": 174.08,
    "dur": 1.15,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "放心"
  },
  {
    "start": 174.54,
    "end": 177.46,
    "dur": 2.92,
    "emotion": "HAPPY",
    "text": "我已经为你准备好甜甜的梦了"
  },
  {
    "start": 233.33,
    "end": 240.7,
    "dur": 7.37,
    "emotion": "HAPPY",
    "text": "你旅途中的见闻比我学习到的知识要精彩太多而且我还能随时提问"
  },
  {
    "start": 240.7,
    "end": 243.84,
    "dur": 3.14,
    "emotion": "HAPPY",
    "text": "把所有的细节都了解到一清二楚"
  },
  {
    "start": 243.84,
    "end": 245.34,
    "dur": 1.5,
    "emotion": "HAPPY",
    "text": "真是太满足了"
  },
  {
    "start": 245.66,
    "end": 246.74,
    "dur": 1.08,
    "emotion": "HAPPY",
    "text": "好啦好啦"
  },
  {
    "start": 246.74,
    "end": 247.91,
    "dur": 1.17,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "别浪费时间"
  },
  {
    "start": 247.91,
    "end": 249.21,
    "dur": 1.3,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "我们快继续吧"
  },
  {
    "start": 255.72,
    "end": 257.95,
    "dur": 2.23,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "天空长出眼睛"
  },
  {
    "start": 257.97,
    "end": 260.41,
    "dur": 2.44,
    "emotion": "HAPPY",
    "text": "是为了见证大地的美好"
  },
  {
    "start": 261.04,
    "end": 263.34,
    "dur": 2.3,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "而本来就拥有双眼的人类"
  },
  {
    "start": 263.41,
    "end": 268.2,
    "dur": 4.79,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "是在什么样的情况下才需要靠神之眼观察这个世界呢"
  },
  {
    "start": 268.9,
    "end": 270.66,
    "dur": 1.76,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "这个问题的答案"
  },
  {
    "start": 270.66,
    "end": 271.93,
    "dur": 1.27,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "聪明的你"
  },
  {
    "start": 271.93,
    "end": 273.05,
    "dur": 1.12,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "能够明白吗"
  },
  {
    "start": 280.94,
    "end": 282.52,
    "dur": 1.58,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "很多时候"
  },
  {
    "start": 282.52,
    "end": 284.74,
    "dur": 2.22,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "我们直到经受切肤之痛"
  },
  {
    "start": 284.74,
    "end": 288.4,
    "dur": 3.66,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "才不得不直视自身的懒惰愚昧"
  },
  {
    "start": 288.4,
    "end": 289.83,
    "dur": 1.43,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "鲁莽或傲慢"
  },
  {
    "start": 290.34,
    "end": 292.37,
    "dur": 2.03,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "但大可不必为此懊悔"
  },
  {
    "start": 292.68,
    "end": 295.78,
    "dur": 3.1,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "我们无法观测未来的所有可能性"
  },
  {
    "start": 295.89,
    "end": 299.81,
    "dur": 3.92,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "只能靠这样略显笨拙的方式获取知识"
  },
  {
    "start": 300.63,
    "end": 303.67,
    "dur": 3.04,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "学费而已再正常不过了"
  },
  {
    "start": 328.31,
    "end": 338.27,
    "dur": 9.96,
    "emotion": "HAPPY",
    "text": "他讲的笑话确实深奥还挺有意思的嗯你有哪句没听懂吗那我解释给你听吧"
  },
  {
    "start": 361.33,
    "end": 364.2,
    "dur": 2.87,
    "emotion": "HAPPY",
    "text": "对整个虚拟而言都是一大幸事"
  },
  {
    "start": 370.46,
    "end": 374.85,
    "dur": 4.39,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "雨林能够对抗死鱼的侵蚀至今都生机焕发"
  },
  {
    "start": 374.92,
    "end": 377.77,
    "dur": 2.85,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "巡邻官们的付出举足轻重"
  },
  {
    "start": 378.11,
    "end": 381.33,
    "dur": 3.22,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "而缇娜里又是他们之中的佼佼者"
  },
  {
    "start": 381.86,
    "end": 383.17,
    "dur": 1.31,
    "emotion": "EMO_UNKNOWN",
    "text": "只是"
  },
  {
    "start": 383.29,
    "end": 385.71,
    "dur": 2.42,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "希望他可以稍稍温柔一些"
  },
  {
    "start": 385.95,
    "end": 389.09,
    "dur": 3.14,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "这样才更有利于巡林员张熙纳贤嘛"
  },
  {
    "start": 393.72,
    "end": 395.75,
    "dur": 2.03,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "我听说过他的故事"
  },
  {
    "start": 396.23,
    "end": 397.65,
    "dur": 1.42,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "他的坚韧"
  },
  {
    "start": 397.65,
    "end": 399.61,
    "dur": 1.96,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "如宝石般璀璨夺目"
  },
  {
    "start": 400.54,
    "end": 402.18,
    "dur": 1.64,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "他经历了太多"
  },
  {
    "start": 402.64,
    "end": 406.17,
    "dur": 3.53,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "希望虚弥的葱绿能够长久的庇护他"
  },
  {
    "start": 406.24,
    "end": 409.81,
    "dur": 3.57,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "令他像普通的女孩子那样健康成长"
  },
  {
    "start": 415.86,
    "end": 418.47,
    "dur": 2.61,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "他拥有很超前的知识体系"
  },
  {
    "start": 418.47,
    "end": 421.47,
    "dur": 3.0,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "并且每时每刻都在保持思考"
  },
  {
    "start": 422.06,
    "end": 425.77,
    "dur": 3.71,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "或许这个世界上没有什么事能瞒过他吧"
  },
  {
    "start": 426.75,
    "end": 428.79,
    "dur": 2.04,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "然而对智慧者而言"
  },
  {
    "start": 428.79,
    "end": 430.48,
    "dur": 1.69,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "普通人的烦忧"
  },
  {
    "start": 430.48,
    "end": 432.77,
    "dur": 2.29,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "是一种与生俱来的错吗"
  },
  {
    "start": 434.72,
    "end": 436.29,
    "dur": 1.57,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "那都是我们"
  },
  {
    "start": 436.29,
    "end": 438.18,
    "dur": 1.89,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "不可分割的一部分"
  },
  {
    "start": 443.34,
    "end": 445.83,
    "dur": 2.49,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "我曾经借用别人的身体"
  },
  {
    "start": 445.83,
    "end": 449.59,
    "dur": 3.76,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "问他想不想让小吉祥草王来看他的舞蹈"
  },
  {
    "start": 450.1,
    "end": 452.71,
    "dur": 2.61,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "虽然我已经悄悄看了很多次"
  },
  {
    "start": 453.19,
    "end": 454.77,
    "dur": 1.58,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "但按理来说"
  },
  {
    "start": 454.77,
    "end": 456.42,
    "dur": 1.65,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "应该要我本人到场"
  },
  {
    "start": 456.42,
    "end": 459.2,
    "dur": 2.78,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "才算是对他花神淡气表演的尊重"
  },
  {
    "start": 460.23,
    "end": 461.48,
    "dur": 1.25,
    "emotion": "EMO_UNKNOWN",
    "text": "结果"
  },
  {
    "start": 461.53,
    "end": 463.77,
    "dur": 2.24,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "我却被委婉的拒绝了"
  },
  {
    "start": 466.26,
    "end": 467.8,
    "dur": 1.54,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "有点伤心"
  },
  {
    "start": 475.18,
    "end": 477.6,
    "dur": 2.42,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "他见到我的第一句话就是"
  },
  {
    "start": 478.11,
    "end": 479.86,
    "dur": 1.75,
    "emotion": "HAPPY",
    "text": "我看上了你的宫殿"
  },
  {
    "start": 503.02,
    "end": 513.47,
    "dur": 10.45,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "他对虚迷推行智慧这一事的理解已经非常接近本质了很可惜的是他掌握的真相无法成为这个国度的主流"
  },
  {
    "start": 514.95,
    "end": 525.74,
    "dur": 10.79,
    "emotion": "SURPRISED",
    "text": "什么你说他和艾尔海森是室友哦世上居然还有这种可能性"
  },
  {
    "start": 532.91,
    "end": 541.65,
    "dur": 8.74,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "他的身体遭受了赤王遗迹中残留力量的影响就像是被时间这只大乌龟不小心甩下了背"
  },
  {
    "start": 541.65,
    "end": 543.35,
    "dur": 1.7,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "永远忘在了身后"
  },
  {
    "start": 544.09,
    "end": 546.13,
    "dur": 2.04,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "如果你感兴趣的话"
  },
  {
    "start": 546.13,
    "end": 549.83,
    "dur": 3.7,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "应该能从他身上窥见过去痴迷的一角吧"
  },
  {
    "start": 556.3,
    "end": 558.66,
    "dur": 2.36,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "好像陈世七执政之间"
  },
  {
    "start": 558.68,
    "end": 561.52,
    "dur": 2.84,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "在很久很久以前还会定期联络"
  },
  {
    "start": 562.08,
    "end": 564.59,
    "dur": 2.51,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "只是我的情况比较特殊"
  },
  {
    "start": 564.59,
    "end": 566.62,
    "dur": 2.03,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "已经不记得这段经历了"
  },
  {
    "start": 568.3,
    "end": 570.84,
    "dur": 2.54,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "既然虚迷的混乱告一段落"
  },
  {
    "start": 571.13,
    "end": 572.18,
    "dur": 1.05,
    "emotion": "EMO_UNKNOWN",
    "text": "我觉得"
  },
  {
    "start": 572.18,
    "end": 574.03,
    "dur": 1.85,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "我该重新见他们一面"
  },
  {
    "start": 574.62,
    "end": 576.67,
    "dur": 2.05,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "你熟识的那几位神明"
  },
  {
    "start": 576.67,
    "end": 578.44,
    "dur": 1.77,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "能为我引荐一下吗"
  },
  {
    "start": 585.08,
    "end": 589.44,
    "dur": 4.36,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "听说玩游戏能够快速缩短人与人之间的距离"
  },
  {
    "start": 589.99,
    "end": 591.86,
    "dur": 1.87,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "谁也是如此吧"
  },
  {
    "start": 592.2,
    "end": 593.12,
    "dur": 0.92,
    "emotion": "SAD",
    "text": "不如"
  },
  {
    "start": 593.17,
    "end": 595.27,
    "dur": 2.1,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "在和大家相聚之后"
  },
  {
    "start": 595.27,
    "end": 597.6,
    "dur": 2.33,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "我就主动提议一起玩跳房子"
  },
  {
    "start": 598.6,
    "end": 599.43,
    "dur": 0.83,
    "emotion": "EMO_UNKNOWN",
    "text": "あ"
  },
  {
    "start": 600.18,
    "end": 610.55,
    "dur": 10.37,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "好像也不合适弄得像是我把房门做成了小小的洞口仗着自己的优势欺负大家一样"
  },
  {
    "start": 661.24,
    "end": 664.1,
    "dur": 2.86,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "我给你分享一些我做过的梦吧"
  },
  {
    "start": 670.28,
    "end": 673.2,
    "dur": 2.92,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "我的梦中总会出现一个花盆"
  },
  {
    "start": 673.77,
    "end": 677.27,
    "dur": 3.5,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "每次浇水施肥就会长出相同的花"
  },
  {
    "start": 678.08,
    "end": 680.4,
    "dur": 2.32,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "对于完全确定的收获"
  },
  {
    "start": 680.6,
    "end": 683.12,
    "dur": 2.52,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "你还能享受养花的过程吗"
  },
  {
    "start": 685.47,
    "end": 686.91,
    "dur": 1.44,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "对我来说"
  },
  {
    "start": 687.63,
    "end": 690.45,
    "dur": 2.82,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "至少每次开花之后飞过的蝴蝶"
  },
  {
    "start": 690.45,
    "end": 692.23,
    "dur": 1.78,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "都有不一样的颜色"
  },
  {
    "start": 692.96,
    "end": 694.16,
    "dur": 1.2,
    "emotion": "NEUTRAL",
    "text": "有时候"
  },
  {
    "start": 694.16,
